OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Highlands benefiting from
OL,4,A'coolcation' trend
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People used to come to the Highlands
OL,7,Fand say, 'it's beautiful ` shame about
OL,8,Fthe weather'. Now they're coming for
OL,9,Fthe weather."
OL,11,FJames MacLeod, concierge at the Glencoe
OL,12,FHouse Hotel, in the Scottish Highlands,
OL,13,Fis talking about how he has noticed a
OL,14,Fbig shift in visitors' perceptions.
OL,16,F"They don't seem to care about the
OL,17,Fmidges or the rain anymore," he
OL,18,Fchuckles. "They're just glad it's not
OL,19,Ftoo hot."
OL,21,FClimate change is redrawing Europe's
OL,22,Fsummer tourism map.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
